# DataHub Test Review

When asked to review tests, check test quality, or validate smoke tests,
follow the skill instructions in `.agent-skills/test-review/SKILL.md`.

## Quick reference

1. Load standards from `.agent-skills/test-review/standards/smoke.md` (authoring: `smoke-test/AGENTS.md`)
2. If a PR number is given, use incremental review mode with `.agent-skills/test-review/scripts/detect-test-changes.sh`
3. Otherwise, gather test files and run a full review
4. Use the sequential fallback workflow (read each file, check against standards, report findings)
5. Generate a report using templates from `.agent-skills/test-review/templates/`

## Scope

- **In scope:** `smoke-test/` Python pytest smoke tests (excluding `tests/cypress/`)
- **Out of scope:** Cypress, Playwright, `metadata-ingestion/tests/unit/`, connector-specific integration tests
